# .trivyignore — Acknowledged CVE exceptions for AzureShop
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, optional trailing comment
# Trivy reads this file automatically when run from the repo root.
# For pipeline scans, mount this file into the container or pass --ignorefile.
#
# IMPORTANT: Every entry here must have a justification comment.
# Review and prune this list every quarter — "ignore" is not "won't fix forever".
#
# Template for new entries:
#   CVE-YYYY-XXXXX  # Package: x.y.z | Risk: accepted because... | Review by: YYYY-MM-DD

# ── npm base image CVEs (2026-05-23) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# These CVEs are in npm's own bundled dependencies inside the Node.js Docker base
# image (node:18-alpine). They are NOT in application code. The app developer
# cannot fix these — only a base image upgrade by the Node.js team resolves them.
# No unfixed fix is available for the current Node LTS tag at time of writing.
# Review by: 2026-08-23

CVE-2024-21538  # Package: cross-spawn (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2025-64756  # Package: glob (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-26996  # Package: minimatch (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-27903  # Package: minimatch (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-27904  # Package: minimatch (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-23745  # Package: tar (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-23950  # Package: tar (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-24842  # Package: tar (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
CVE-2026-26960  # Package: tar (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23
