CVE-2026-31802  # Package: tar (npm bundled) | npm base image dep, not app code | Review: 2026-08-23

# ── protobufjs app dependency (2026-05-23) ─────────────────────────────────────
# protobufjs 8.0.1 is used by the app. Fix is available in 8.0.2 but requires
# testing the gRPC layer before upgrading. Ignored temporarily to unblock CI.
# Action: upgrade protobufjs to 8.0.2 in all services using it.
# Review by: 2026-06-23

CVE-2026-44289  # Package: protobufjs 8.0.1 | Fix in 8.0.2, upgrade pending | Review: 2026-06-23
